WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:30.100 --> 01:33.310
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

01:34.270 --> 01:37.140
Your heart... pick up!

01:44.360 --> 01:47.740
Huh? Why was I here again?

01:47.740 --> 01:49.500
See ya, Kato-san.

01:49.500 --> 01:50.920
Yeah.

01:51.740 --> 01:53.210
Vanilla?

01:53.540 --> 01:57.580
And here I was planning on taking
Noguchi-kun's heart.

01:57.580 --> 01:59.720
Why the constant cherrypicking?

02:00.210 --> 02:03.380
I wasn't cherrypicking!

02:03.380 --> 02:06.060
I had no idea you were
going to take his heart.

02:06.460 --> 02:11.010
Besides, I can't help it if
Noguchi's heart showed up for me.

02:11.010 --> 02:12.300
True.

02:12.300 --> 02:15.570
But I've got another idea.

02:19.640 --> 02:22.000
That's Ian-kun from
the class next door.

02:22.480 --> 02:26.500
Why don't we have a race to see which of us can take his heart first?

02:26.500 --> 02:26.950
Huh?!

02:27.400 --> 02:33.230
The loser is banned from taking the
hearts of boys in other classes.

02:34.450 --> 02:36.970
Fine by me. I'll take you on.

02:41.580 --> 02:44.980
Chocolat x Pierre, An Adventure for Two.

02:45.800 --> 02:49.300
I never thought that I'd be fighting
with Vanilla like this.

02:49.300 --> 02:52.190
It just doesn't feel right.

02:54.520 --> 02:58.030
Ian? I heard that he likes the ocean.

02:58.030 --> 03:00.360
Apparently he's a surfer.

03:00.890 --> 03:06.360
His parents are divorced,
and his dad is living in Australia.

03:06.360 --> 03:09.070
Thanks for all the information.

03:09.070 --> 03:12.250
But why all the questions about Ian?

03:13.530 --> 03:16.210
I find him... fascinating.

03:16.620 --> 03:18.950
Ice-san... likes that guy!

03:18.950 --> 03:20.040
No way!

03:21.370 --> 03:22.980
Noir...

03:23.500 --> 03:27.130
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

03:32.120 --> 03:34.190
Noir, gather to me!

03:51.990 --> 03:54.410
Vanilla's incredible...

03:54.410 --> 03:58.170
She's on the fast track
to pick up Ian's heart.

04:05.460 --> 04:06.680
G-good afternoon.

04:11.890 --> 04:15.390
Don't pretend you can't hear
me when I'm talking to you!

04:15.390 --> 04:17.140
Put a sock in it, will ya?

04:17.140 --> 04:19.720
I hate girls.

04:19.720 --> 04:22.310
Especially tomboys, they're the worst.

04:23.410 --> 04:24.780
In other words, you.

04:25.350 --> 04:28.310
How about you just not talk to me?

04:28.310 --> 04:29.290
Umm...

04:29.730 --> 04:34.000
They told me that the picture-books of
sea creatures were in this section.

04:34.610 --> 04:36.200
Vanilla...

04:37.570 --> 04:38.870
Here.

04:39.750 --> 04:42.470
Thank you very much!

04:47.170 --> 04:49.930
Hey, what's that?

04:49.930 --> 04:51.920
Oh, this?

04:51.920 --> 04:54.050
I wanted to know
the name of this seashell.

04:54.550 --> 04:58.050
Ian-kun keeps a shell
like this in his room.

04:58.050 --> 05:02.560
When his father moved to Australia,
he left it behind as a memento.

05:02.560 --> 05:05.360
That shell's called a Bone Shell.

05:05.360 --> 05:08.200
It's also known as a Venus Comb.

05:08.650 --> 05:10.270
So that's what is is!

05:10.270 --> 05:12.750
I have this seashell in my room.

05:13.200 --> 05:15.710
I've got one in my room, too.

05:16.110 --> 05:19.660
Whenever I'm feeling sad,
I hold it up to my ear...

05:19.660 --> 05:21.210
and listen to the sound of the ocean.

05:22.740 --> 05:24.740
Want to come see it?

05:24.740 --> 05:28.470
At my house, we've got a pool
that could pass for the ocean.

05:28.470 --> 05:31.420
You just have to come, lan-kun!

05:32.500 --> 05:33.720
I'm coming too!

05:35.300 --> 05:37.480
U-us too!

05:37.840 --> 05:41.550
I wanna see this pool that's
just like the ocean, too!

05:41.550 --> 05:44.220
Vanilla-chan's house,
Vanilla-chan's house!

05:44.220 --> 05:46.160
So, can we come? Can we?

05:46.730 --> 05:49.160
If everyone else is going,
I can tag along.

05:49.560 --> 05:53.270
That's just fine,
as long as you're there.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.480
In that case...

05:54.480 --> 05:59.070
we should invite Rika-chan, Nanako-chan,
and the others, Chocolat-chan.

05:59.070 --> 05:59.880
Yeah.

06:00.490 --> 06:03.870
My magic will be stronger
at Pierre's mansion.

06:03.870 --> 06:06.650
I'll pick up as many black
hearts as I possibly can.

06:07.330 --> 06:11.580
And I'll give Chocolat-chan
a taste of my power as well.

06:17.820 --> 06:22.930
Vanilla-sama's been chanting
that spell for hours now.

06:22.930 --> 06:25.070
Just what does she intend to do?

06:30.480 --> 06:31.810
Vanilla...

06:31.810 --> 06:35.110
If you push yourself too hard,
you'll come to regret it.

06:35.110 --> 06:36.120
I'll be fine.

06:36.650 --> 06:39.360
By tomorrow, I will have made
this place into a beach.

06:39.360 --> 06:41.110
With the power of Noir.

06:41.110 --> 06:46.450
Ian will become my prisoner for sure.

06:47.080 --> 06:48.460
Is this the place?

06:48.460 --> 06:50.020
It's huge!

06:50.020 --> 06:52.960
Vanilla-chan's house,
Vanilla-chan's house!

06:52.960 --> 06:55.970
So where's this pool that
could pass for an ocean?

06:56.550 --> 06:58.690
This is... Pierre's house.

07:01.590 --> 07:03.260
Welcome!

07:03.260 --> 07:05.140
Thanks for having us!

07:08.520 --> 07:10.580
It's through here.

07:25.950 --> 07:28.660
This is amazing!

07:28.660 --> 07:30.500
It really is the ocean!

07:30.500 --> 07:32.090
It's too big.

07:32.500 --> 07:34.000
Wonderful!

07:34.000 --> 07:35.600
Yeah, let's go swimming!

07:36.090 --> 07:37.800
Take that!

07:37.800 --> 07:38.880
Quit it!

07:38.880 --> 07:40.610
Tunnel!

07:57.020 --> 08:01.780
There's no way a real pool could
feel just like the ocean.

08:01.780 --> 08:04.330
Vanilla must've made it with magic.

08:04.910 --> 08:08.170
How much Noir did she use, anyway?

08:08.490 --> 08:10.450
Ian's favorite things...

08:10.450 --> 08:12.080
Ian's memories...

08:12.080 --> 08:13.580
Ian's mind...

08:13.580 --> 08:17.040
This world is based on what
I've learned about him.

08:17.040 --> 08:20.520
I've done it. He is now my prisoner.

08:21.960 --> 08:26.720
Oh no. Maybe I used
too much of my power...

08:26.720 --> 08:28.850
You okay, Ice?

08:28.850 --> 08:31.140
I will be, once I rest a little.

08:31.140 --> 08:33.890
Ian-kun, will you stay with me?

08:33.890 --> 08:35.640
Yahoo!

08:40.360 --> 08:42.480
This is so fun!

08:43.440 --> 08:44.750
Ian-kun?

08:45.200 --> 08:47.250
Yahoo!

08:47.250 --> 08:50.450
Whoa, how'd she get so good?

08:50.450 --> 08:52.410
That's Kato for you.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.930
That was totally radical!

08:58.790 --> 09:00.750
Ian-kun?

09:00.750 --> 09:03.140
Sorry, I'll be right back!

09:05.130 --> 09:06.300
Yo!

09:06.300 --> 09:06.980
Ian.

09:07.550 --> 09:09.720
So, you surf?

09:09.720 --> 09:11.720
Nope. First time.

09:11.720 --> 09:12.060
Huh?

09:12.610 --> 09:14.530
Surfing is such a blast!

09:15.060 --> 09:16.100
Isn't it?

09:16.100 --> 09:19.200
There's nothing like that moment
when you first ride a wave!

09:19.560 --> 09:20.450
Yeah!

09:22.400 --> 09:24.460
Why...

09:24.820 --> 09:29.960
Ian-kun... why is your heart showing
up for Chocolat-chan?

09:29.960 --> 09:34.370
Me too... I can...

09:34.370 --> 09:37.420
If nothing else,
I can go body-boarding...

09:37.420 --> 09:39.040
I can do it!

09:47.520 --> 09:50.300
Use your hands, not your head!

09:50.300 --> 09:52.230
Look out there.

09:52.850 --> 09:54.600
Vanilla-chan?

09:54.600 --> 09:57.640
Is she... drowning?

09:57.640 --> 09:59.740
Chocolat! Chocolat!

10:00.310 --> 10:01.740
Vanilla-chan's drowning!

10:03.980 --> 10:05.310
Vanilla?!

10:16.950 --> 10:18.590
Vanilla, stay calm.

10:20.210 --> 10:21.600
Chocolat-chan...

10:22.170 --> 10:24.380
Kato, grab the board!

10:24.380 --> 10:27.100
I'll be fine. Please help Vanilla!

10:27.670 --> 10:29.340
Okay!

10:29.340 --> 10:32.440
Grab ahold of it, Vanilla!

10:34.310 --> 10:37.950
Thank goodness Vanilla
is still the same.

10:38.520 --> 10:41.270
She used Noir to make
this beautiful ocean,

10:41.270 --> 10:44.230
and then almost drowns herself in it.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.570
Huh?

10:46.570 --> 10:48.910
My body... won't move.

10:56.330 --> 10:58.830
Am I... drowning?

10:59.370 --> 11:02.890
The power of Noir strikes again.

11:06.210 --> 11:08.380
Pierre...?

11:22.350 --> 11:24.900
What? Chocolat's not here.

11:24.900 --> 11:27.570
It couldn't be! She didn't come up?

11:27.570 --> 11:29.500
What?

11:29.500 --> 11:31.570
Kato!!

11:31.570 --> 11:32.710
Chocolat!!

11:33.160 --> 11:35.970
Kato!

11:33.160 --> 11:35.970
Chocolat!

11:36.410 --> 11:39.500
Chocolat-chan risked
herself to save me...

11:39.500 --> 11:41.980
This is all my fault!

11:43.000 --> 11:44.130
C'mon.

11:44.130 --> 11:44.930
Yeah.

12:01.320 --> 12:06.860
No... if I pass OUT,
the magic will wear off.

12:06.860 --> 12:10.400
Please... save Chocolat-chan!

12:10.400 --> 12:14.570
If the sea disappears now,
Chocolat will be trapped inside.

12:14.570 --> 12:16.820
It's likely that she'll
never come back again.

12:16.820 --> 12:21.290
Now, it's time for you
to sleep, Vanilla-sama.

12:26.210 --> 12:28.660
What were we doing?

12:28.660 --> 12:30.630
Why are we in swimsuits?

12:31.340 --> 12:34.090
For that matter, where are we?

12:35.700 --> 12:41.100
The memories of those children have sunk to the bottom of the sea, along with Chocolat.

12:41.100 --> 12:43.900
Wait. What happened to Pierre-sama?

12:43.900 --> 12:47.480
Surely he wasn't with Chocolat?

12:53.360 --> 12:54.900
Damn.

12:54.900 --> 12:58.780
No matter how far up I swim,
I can't reach the surface.

12:58.780 --> 13:01.080
Are we trapped in here?

13:02.790 --> 13:04.580
A cave?

13:16.590 --> 13:17.690
Where am I?

13:19.010 --> 13:22.140
Pierre... why?

13:22.140 --> 13:23.680
Where are we?

13:23.680 --> 13:26.020
Could it be that you saved me?

13:26.020 --> 13:29.770
Not another word.
I'm regretting it, myself.

13:29.770 --> 13:31.900
Just this once, can you be quiet?

13:31.900 --> 13:34.150
What're you regretting?

13:34.150 --> 13:37.280
Anyway, do you know
what this place is?

13:37.280 --> 13:38.860
Can't say that I do.

13:38.860 --> 13:40.990
It's the Forgotten Path.

13:40.990 --> 13:42.550
The "Forgotten Path"?

13:42.950 --> 13:45.700
Some passages between the Magical
and Human Worlds...

13:45.700 --> 13:49.120
are fixed in place, like the Big
Pot and the Moon Door.

13:49.120 --> 13:52.630
Others are so unstable that you never
know where you'll wind up.

13:52.630 --> 13:55.260
But it has to lead somewhere, right?

13:55.260 --> 13:58.050
I bet we'll find an exit
if we look for it.

13:58.050 --> 13:59.840
An exit?

13:59.840 --> 14:03.460
You might arrive at tomorrow,
or 100 years from now.

14:03.970 --> 14:05.520
No way!

14:05.520 --> 14:07.850
Sugar Sugar Rune!

14:07.850 --> 14:09.310
What?

14:09.310 --> 14:11.520
Sugar Sugar Rune!

14:11.520 --> 14:13.270
It's pointless.

14:13.270 --> 14:16.360
I tried over and over again,
but nothing worked.

14:16.360 --> 14:19.200
It seems like we can't
use magic in here.

14:19.200 --> 14:21.240
Thanks for the breaking news!

14:21.240 --> 14:25.630
All we have here is water, air,
and some useless glowing crystals.

14:25.630 --> 14:30.420
And all we can do here is
keep wandering around until we die.

14:31.050 --> 14:33.420
What a disgrace.

14:33.420 --> 14:37.460
When I saw Chocolat drowning, and
then jumped in to save her...

14:37.460 --> 14:40.060
it was almost a reflex action
I don't understand.

14:40.060 --> 14:43.690
Thanks... for saving me.

14:50.270 --> 14:53.270
Look, it's brighter over there.

14:53.270 --> 14:54.860
It must be the exit.

14:56.900 --> 15:00.240
All I did was thank him like people
do in the Human World.

15:00.240 --> 15:04.870
After all, he did
risk his life to save me.

15:04.870 --> 15:07.220
Brrr!

15:07.220 --> 15:10.390
Wear this. It's already dry.

15:13.080 --> 15:16.460
Is this the real Pierre?

15:17.420 --> 15:21.470
He's always cold,
and never lets his guard down.

15:24.850 --> 15:26.640
Or is he...

15:27.350 --> 15:30.220
trying to trick me again?

15:33.730 --> 15:36.190
Ah, how pretty~

15:36.190 --> 15:37.820
Yeah, pretty strange.

15:37.820 --> 15:40.120
There shouldn't be
anything living here.

15:46.580 --> 15:49.540
What's with that ginormous spider?

15:49.540 --> 15:50.970
This thing is...

15:57.920 --> 16:01.300
Run! You'll be erased if
that web touches you!

16:17.980 --> 16:19.070
S-sorry.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.960
That spider is...

16:23.960 --> 16:24.910
Vacuum.

16:24.910 --> 16:26.070
Vacuum?

16:26.070 --> 16:30.510
Le Royaume created it to wipe
out the Forgotten Path.

16:30.510 --> 16:33.790
It's a "cleaning" device that erases
both matter and space.

16:33.790 --> 16:36.120
Chances are, the Unending Night
lies beyond that web.

16:36.580 --> 16:39.880
It won't stop its chase until
it dematerializes us.

16:39.880 --> 16:41.340
It can't be.

16:41.340 --> 16:42.100
Chocolat...

16:42.630 --> 16:44.850
Can you trust what I say?

16:47.510 --> 16:48.850
Answer me.

16:48.850 --> 16:53.680
As long as we're stuck in here,
Pierre's not the Ogre Prince.

16:53.680 --> 16:56.730
And I'm not a Queen Candidate, either.

16:56.730 --> 16:57.870
I trust you!

17:00.330 --> 17:05.570
I'm going to climb up to
where those icicles are.

17:05.570 --> 17:10.380
When I give the signal, you come
out and draw the spider that way.

17:10.380 --> 17:12.200
Does that mean...

17:12.200 --> 17:14.910
you're going to use me as bait?

17:14.910 --> 17:16.160
You catch on quick.

17:16.620 --> 17:19.330
It'll only be for a moment.

17:19.330 --> 17:20.640
Don't be reckless.

17:37.690 --> 17:39.440
That thing's...

17:39.440 --> 17:41.690
spotted Pierre!

17:41.690 --> 17:42.650
Pie-!

17:42.650 --> 17:47.450
No! If I scream now, Pierre might fall!

17:50.410 --> 17:53.160
You are my steed!

17:53.160 --> 17:55.130
So settle down and behave!

17:55.620 --> 17:57.180
Chocolat!

17:58.500 --> 18:00.670
Chocolat, get out of the way!

18:01.420 --> 18:03.500
Here we go again.

18:03.500 --> 18:06.050
As always, "planning" is
a foreign concept to her.

18:06.050 --> 18:08.050
But before I knew it,
I had already jumped.

18:12.260 --> 18:14.720
For her sake, I could sacrifice my life.

18:14.720 --> 18:16.400
For my witch.

18:16.980 --> 18:18.520
Pierre...?

18:20.150 --> 18:22.770
Why didn't you stick to the plan?

18:22.770 --> 18:26.730
I told you... not to be reckless.

18:30.720 --> 18:34.950
Whatever I do,
I mustn't fall in love with him.

18:34.950 --> 18:38.410
No matter how close we get...

18:38.410 --> 18:40.330
We can't!

18:42.250 --> 18:44.090
What?

18:44.090 --> 18:46.380
The wound on its back
is emitting drops of darkness...

18:46.380 --> 18:49.220
The darkness is overflowing
and expanding!

18:49.220 --> 18:50.710
It'll absorb us!

18:51.710 --> 18:54.890
Chocolat, don't let go of my hand!

18:59.690 --> 19:02.350
Is this the Unending Night?

19:02.350 --> 19:04.900
I'm not scared at all.

19:04.900 --> 19:07.400
Is it because I'm
holding hands with Pierre?

19:07.940 --> 19:12.630
I get the feeling that something like
this happened a long time ago.

19:17.080 --> 19:18.570
What is it now?

19:19.120 --> 19:24.130
That was me and Vanilla jumping into the Big Pot to come to the Human World.

19:24.130 --> 19:25.670
Another one!

19:25.670 --> 19:28.760
That was me, just after coming
to the Human World.

19:28.760 --> 19:32.680
That's right!
These are Memory Screens.

19:32.680 --> 19:38.010
That's the party they threw for us
before we left the Magical World!

19:44.810 --> 19:46.230
Huh?!

19:44.810 --> 19:46.230
Wha!?

19:48.820 --> 19:50.320
That last one was...

19:50.320 --> 19:52.570
Why are the two of us together?

19:54.620 --> 19:56.570
Chocolat!

19:57.160 --> 19:59.050
Pierre!

19:59.050 --> 20:05.180
I... knew Pierre... in the past?

20:08.170 --> 20:10.710
Pierre-sama, are you unharmed?

20:18.260 --> 20:19.740
Chocolat...

20:19.740 --> 20:21.510
What a relief!

20:23.020 --> 20:24.120
Where...?

20:24.690 --> 20:26.480
My mansion.

20:26.480 --> 20:27.330
Robin...

20:27.900 --> 20:31.360
We had a hard time finding
out where you were.

20:31.360 --> 20:34.320
I take it you were
in the Forgotten Path?

20:34.320 --> 20:35.860
Where's Pierre?

20:35.860 --> 20:40.870
The Ogres made their own gate and
saved him, just like we did for you.

20:42.410 --> 20:47.130
If I told you once, I've told you a thousand
times to stay away from the Ogres.

20:47.130 --> 20:48.880
I'm sorry.

20:48.880 --> 20:52.550
Oh well. Hurry on home
and get to bed.

20:52.550 --> 20:53.300
Okay.

20:54.840 --> 20:58.390
Chocolat-chan, I'm so sorry!

20:58.390 --> 20:59.320
Pierre?

20:59.850 --> 21:02.350
Are you all right, Vanilla?

21:02.350 --> 21:03.980
What about Chocolat-chan?

21:03.980 --> 21:05.270
She's safe.

21:05.270 --> 21:08.910
And probably back at home by now.

21:09.310 --> 21:13.280
How could you go to Pierre's
mansion without telling us?

21:13.280 --> 21:14.650
It was because...

21:14.650 --> 21:17.690
Hey, someone's down there.

21:18.240 --> 21:19.710
Ian...

21:20.780 --> 21:23.420
Hey Ian, what's up?

21:23.420 --> 21:26.710
I had the strangest dream...

21:26.710 --> 21:30.250
about surfing with you.

21:30.250 --> 21:32.180
It was tons of fun!

21:32.180 --> 21:38.180
So I came here to ask if you'd go surfing
with me for real this summer.

21:38.180 --> 21:39.800
So, will you?

21:39.800 --> 21:41.350
Yeah, sure!

21:41.350 --> 21:44.300
Sorry for being so harsh
with you at school.

21:44.850 --> 21:46.310
See you tomorrow!

21:46.310 --> 21:47.180
Yeah!

21:47.990 --> 21:52.000
Vanilla, let's call this match off.

21:52.480 --> 21:56.530
We shouldn't gamble
with human hearts.

21:57.450 --> 22:01.990
Pierre-sama, the Night of Walpurgis
is fast approaching.

22:01.990 --> 22:06.630
Shouldn't we Ogres join
the festivities as well?

22:06.630 --> 22:10.890
Along with our Ogre Princess, that is.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
